============================================================================================
 INCLUSION-EXCLUSION ANATOMY of cap_k = meas(lonely(minimizer_j)),  k = 13-j
============================================================================================

 j=1 (k=12), minimizer P=[1]:
   orders r=0..1: O0=1, O1=-1/7
   ORDER_0+1 = 1 - j/7 = 6/7 = 0.85714
   ORDER_2 (pairwise total, signed +) = 0 (target C(j,2)/91 = 0)
   pairwise truncation O0+O1+O2 = 6/7 = 0.857143
   ORDERS>=3 (net high-order) = 0 = 0.000000  (VANISH)
   TRUE meas(lonely) = 6/7 = 0.857143
   pair-Pascal C(14-j,2)/91 = 6/7 = 0.857143   dip = pascal - true = 0

 j=2 (k=11), minimizer P=[1, 13]:
